# Typing, setting a due date from the slash menu mid-edit, typing on, then undoing: the text after the menu, the date and the text before it come off one step each.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
	- Slides
END
keys j <Enter>
type  abc
type /due tom
see Due Tomorrow
keys <Enter>
type  def
keys <Esc>
see ▌   - Report abc def
see 󱙬 tomorrow
keys z
see ▌   - Report abc
see 󱙬 tomorrow
keys z
hide tomorrow
keys z
see ▌   - Report
hide abc
keys Z Z
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report abc @due({today+1})
	- Slides
END
